4
00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:18.707
Today we learn: Urban vs Rural Life. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:23.986
Metropolis. Say it with me. Metropolis!

6
00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:31.461
Countryside. Say it with me. Countryside!

7
00:00:34.929 --> 00:00:39.663
Population density. Say it with me. Population density!

8
00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:47.567
Infrastructure. Say it with me. Infrastructure!

9
00:00:51.126 --> 00:00:55.109
Agricultural. Say it with me. Agricultural!

10
00:00:58.581 --> 00:01:02.647
Fast-paced. Say it with me. Fast-paced!

11
00:01:06.123 --> 00:01:09.640
Tranquil. Say it with me. Tranquil!

12
00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:16.626
Commute. Say it with me. Commute!

13
00:01:20.124 --> 00:01:24.507
Community feel. Say it with me. Community feel!

14
00:01:28.009 --> 00:01:32.459
Urban sprawl. Say it with me. Urban sprawl!

15
00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:39.988
Amenities. Say it with me. Amenities!

16
00:01:43.442 --> 00:01:47.342
Lifestyle. Say it with me. Lifestyle!

17
00:01:50.873 --> 00:02:02.453
Grammar time! Comparatives and superlatives. Listen. The city is busier. The countryside is the most peaceful place.

18
00:02:02.503 --> 00:02:09.975
Your turn. Say it with me. The city is busier. The countryside is the most peaceful place.

19
00:02:14.964 --> 00:02:25.783
City life in a metropolis is fast-paced, unlike the tranquil countryside. Urban areas offer more amenities, but rural life has a stronger community feel.

20
00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:27.391
I like this story!

21
00:02:28.341 --> 00:02:33.590
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.309
Population density!

23
00:02:36.378 --> 00:02:41.547
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:41.597 --> 00:02:42.747
Tranquil!

25
00:02:43.653 --> 00:02:53.248
Think and answer. Would you rather live in a city or the countryside? Why?

26
00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:54.455
Great answer!

27
00:02:55.630 --> 00:03:00.358
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

